[{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0645","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0645.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-56750","title":"Gitea Remember-Me令牌验证缺陷导致攻击者会话未失效漏洞","description":"Gitea 的 Remember-Me 自动登录令牌验证逻辑存在安全缺陷，当攻击者窃取用户的 Remember-Me 令牌并用于认证时，系统虽能检测到令牌哈希不匹配，但仅删除受害者本地的 Cookie，未从数据库中删除已被攻陷的令牌记录，导致攻击者已建立的活跃会话持续有效且不会被撤销。攻击者可通过窃取令牌绕过身份验证，长期维持对受害者账户的未授权访问。该漏洞影响 Gitea 所有使用 Remember-Me 功能的版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。官方已发布安全更新修复此问题。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-56750","GHSA-rgv6-xp99-6mgj"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即升级 Gitea 至 v1.27.0 或更高版本（对应 commit de4b8277e9cb576f2315fb03b5ab6478b42a1d31 和 f69e15afe7496cc62e96dab244629c69eb31a7bf）。如无法立即升级，建议在反向代理层对 `/user/login` 端点添加速率限制，并强制所有用户登出后重新登录以清除已有 Remember-Me 令牌。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/code.gitea.io/gitea/CVE-2026-56750.yml","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/8fb1620294bff0cde2c82bba8543a916d4f0215c/2026/CVE-2026-56750.json","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/7f04fb463deb2e42d892e6f9165c6eaca2feb1b6/data/osv/GO-2026-6072.json","https://github.com/RogoLabs/consensus-engine/blob/1492d9d80c64faf5568e48afb45bc3538bc6f9e0/docs/data/2026/CVE-2026-56750.json","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/7f04fb463deb2e42d892e6f9165c6eaca2feb1b6/data/reports/GO-2026-6072.yaml","https://github.com/rinz0x0cruz/exploitrank/blob/9f4c8add5cfa40b9d0aceff1e12c078575600f8b/data/history/CVE-2026-56750.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/236c7f1b4d135ead6953d68767892f06687ce11d/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-rgv6-xp99-6mgj/GHSA-rgv6-xp99-6mgj.json","https://github.com/proshiba/vuln-intel-agent/blob/1f0b4d834689f794b1d2ed00137cff546bba1cbe/reports/daily/2026/07/2026-07-17.md","https://github.com/bitfront-se/vuln-list-temp/blob/e20b4f20e4d3f1b9471c564d85e48ff4d55d757b/osv/go/gitea.dev/GO-2026-6072.json","https://github.com/anajuliabit/aeon/blob/0c015b8c3cab5a7907f67740b38f0ee376d69f7e/adv-critical.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0645.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0644","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0644.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-56657","title":"Gitea SSH密钥解析拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Gitea SSH 密钥解析器存在拒绝服务漏洞。Gitea 的 SSH 密钥导入接口接受 RFC 4716（SSH2）格式的密钥，在规范化处理时，parseKeyString 函数使用 Go 字符串的 += 操作逐行拼接密钥内容。由于 Go 字符串不可变，每次拼接都会分配新内存并复制整个累积字符串，导致时间复杂度为 O(N²)。任何已认证用户均可通过 POST /api/v1/user/keys 接口提交一个包含大量短行（如 40 万行、每行 100 字符）的恶意 SSH2 公钥，使服务器消耗大量 CPU 和内存资源，导致实例离线。该漏洞影响 Gitea ≤ 1.26.4 版本，已在 1.27.0 版本中修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-56657","GHSA-4xjf-493q-98p3"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即将 Gitea 升级至 v1.27.0 或更高版本（该版本在 `models/asymkey/ssh_key_parse.go` 中增加了 SSH 公钥输入长度限制，并将 O(n²) 字符串拼接改为 strings.Builder）。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理层限制 `POST /api/v1/user/keys` 接口的请求体大小（建议 ≤1MB），并监控 CPU/内存异常飙升。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/code.gitea.io/gitea/CVE-2026-56657.yml","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/c376806cb2dc05fbeb559b5b1364bc1c095ae81e/2026/CVE-2026-56657.json","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/7f04fb463deb2e42d892e6f9165c6eaca2feb1b6/data/osv/GO-2026-6042.json","https://github.com/RogoLabs/consensus-engine/blob/1492d9d80c64faf5568e48afb45bc3538bc6f9e0/docs/data/2026/CVE-2026-56657.json","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/7f04fb463deb2e42d892e6f9165c6eaca2feb1b6/data/reports/GO-2026-6042.yaml","https://github.com/rinz0x0cruz/exploitrank/blob/9f4c8add5cfa40b9d0aceff1e12c078575600f8b/data/history/CVE-2026-56657.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/236c7f1b4d135ead6953d68767892f06687ce11d/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-4xjf-493q-98p3/GHSA-4xjf-493q-98p3.json","https://github.com/bmwiedemann/openSUSE/blob/2de2525ff4f22f16243444d8222f304029402f46/packages/g/govulncheck-vulndb/govulncheck-vulndb.changes","https://github.com/proshiba/vuln-intel-agent/blob/1f0b4d834689f794b1d2ed00137cff546bba1cbe/reports/daily/2026/07/2026-07-17.md","https://github.com/midnightconman/go_vulndb/blob/d993e2e5e84dd30ceb1958dc17e25f002fffd6f7/ID/GO-2026-6042.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0644.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0644.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0644.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0643","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0643.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-56654","title":"Gitea Gitea 访问令牌权限提升漏洞","description":"Gitea 的 API 中创建个人访问令牌的端点（POST /users/{username}/tokens）存在权限提升漏洞。当攻击者将受限的访问令牌以 Authorization: Basic <token>:x-oauth-basic 格式提交时，Basic 认证处理器会验证该令牌并设置 AuthedMethod=\"basic\"，导致 IsBasicAuth 被错误置为 true，从而绕过 reqBasicOrRevProxyAuth 中间件的密码认证检查。随后令牌创建处理器未对请求的作用域进行上限校验，未检查请求的作用域是否为调用者令牌作用域的子集。攻击者只需获取到任意受限作用域的令牌（如从泄露的 CI 密钥中获得的 write:user 令牌），即可在不知晓账户密码的情况下创建具有 all 完全权限的新令牌，实现权限提升。该漏洞影响所有使用 Gitea 且暴露 API 的部署实例。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-56654","GHSA-683j-3ff6-hh2x"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即升级 Gitea 至 v1.27.0 或更高版本，该版本已修复 Basic 认证中间件绕过和令牌作用域未校验的问题。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理层限制对 POST /users/{username}/tokens 端点的访问，仅允许受信任 IP 调用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/code.gitea.io/gitea/CVE-2026-56654.yml","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/6db804ac9380f31f71f86be4f4f8d98e65f04ec3/2026/CVE-2026-56654.json","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/7f04fb463deb2e42d892e6f9165c6eaca2feb1b6/data/osv/GO-2026-6034.json","https://github.com/RogoLabs/consensus-engine/blob/1492d9d80c64faf5568e48afb45bc3538bc6f9e0/docs/data/2026/CVE-2026-56654.json","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/7f04fb463deb2e42d892e6f9165c6eaca2feb1b6/data/reports/GO-2026-6034.yaml","https://github.com/rinz0x0cruz/exploitrank/blob/9f4c8add5cfa40b9d0aceff1e12c078575600f8b/data/history/CVE-2026-56654.json","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/4c78cd5d24b69fef6dc523cc3a507b4dbf47a389/posts/cve-2026-56654-go-code-gitea-io-gitea.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/236c7f1b4d135ead6953d68767892f06687ce11d/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-683j-3ff6-hh2x/GHSA-683j-3ff6-hh2x.json","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/4c78cd5d24b69fef6dc523cc3a507b4dbf47a389/api/intel/products/cve-2026-56654-go-code-gitea-io-gitea.json","https://github.com/bmwiedemann/openSUSE/blob/2de2525ff4f22f16243444d8222f304029402f46/packages/g/govulncheck-vulndb/govulncheck-vulndb.changes"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0643.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0643.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0643.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0642","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0642.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-56443","title":"Gitea 代码托管平台 令牌作用域权限绕过漏洞","description":"Gitea 的 public-only（公开范围限制）个人访问令牌（PAT）在 Repository（仓库）和 Package（软件包）作用域类别中存在权限绕过漏洞。在 Gitea 1.26.2 版本中，尽管 PR #37118（CVE-2026-25714）已统一了 Org/User/ActivityPub 类别下 public-only 令牌的过滤逻辑（使用 `!Visibility.IsPublic()` 进行检查），但 Repository 和 Package 类别仍使用 `repo.IsPrivate` 或 `Owner.Visibility.IsPrivate()` 进行权限判断。由于 `VisibleTypeLimited`（受限可见性）并不等同于 `VisibleTypePrivate`（私有），导致 `IsPrivate()` 对受限用户返回 `false`，使得 public-only PAT 在受限可见性用户上能够访问到超出匿名用户权限范围的内容。该漏洞影响 4 个入口点：API v1 的 `checkTokenPublicOnly` Package 分支（`routers/api/v1/api.go:292`）、`reqPackageAccess` 中间件（`routers/api/packages/api.go:76`）、`TokenCanAccessRepo` 辅助函数以及 `CheckTokenScopes`（`services/context/permission.go:32`）。攻击者只需创建一个带有 `public-only` 范围的 PAT，即可读取受限可见性用户的私有仓库内容（包括 README、问题、PR、标签等）、下载私有软件包（如通过 PUT 上传的通用包），并通过 Git HTTPS 智能协议获取完整克隆能力。在实际验证中，使用同一 PAT 对同一受限用户分别测试 User 类别（返回 403）和 Repository 类别（返回 200 并返回内容），证实该绕过存在。匿名用户在相同端点上返回 401/404，进一步确认 PAT 确实获得了不应有的访问权限。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-56443","GHSA-7p4h-3gxq-x3h3"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 Gitea 至包含 CVE-2026-56443 修复的版本（1.26.3 或更高版本）。若无法立即升级，临时缓解措施：在 Gitea 管理后台禁用所有 public-only scope 的个人访问令牌（PAT），或限制 Visibility=Limited 的用户不使用 PAT 访问 API。升级前可手动应用补丁：将 `routers/api/v1/api.go` 第 292 行和 `routers/api/packages/api.go` 第 76 行的 `Owner.Visibility.IsPrivate()` 改为 `!Owner.Visibility.IsPublic()`；将 `services/context/api.go` 中 `TokenCanAccessRepo` 函数的返回条件改为 `!repo.IsPrivate && repo.Owner != nil && repo.Owner.Visibility.IsPublic()`；将 `services/context/permission.go` 第 32 行的 `repo.IsPrivate` 改为 `repo.IsPrivate || (repo.Owner != nil && !repo.Owner.Visibility.IsPublic())`。修改后重启 Gitea 服务生效。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/code.gitea.io/gitea/CVE-2026-56443.yml","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/09e0eb937d6858d58d5e2a369c15112b42549508/2026/CVE-2026-56443.json","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/7f04fb463deb2e42d892e6f9165c6eaca2feb1b6/data/osv/GO-2026-6045.json","https://github.com/RogoLabs/consensus-engine/blob/1492d9d80c64faf5568e48afb45bc3538bc6f9e0/docs/data/2026/CVE-2026-56443.json","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/7f04fb463deb2e42d892e6f9165c6eaca2feb1b6/data/reports/GO-2026-6045.yaml","https://github.com/rinz0x0cruz/exploitrank/blob/9f4c8add5cfa40b9d0aceff1e12c078575600f8b/data/history/CVE-2026-56443.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/236c7f1b4d135ead6953d68767892f06687ce11d/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-7p4h-3gxq-x3h3/GHSA-7p4h-3gxq-x3h3.json","https://github.com/JebeenLee/JebeenLee/blob/6440127d6b7904d7ff4b8769aa5bafa0e5a9d8de/README.md","https://github.com/bmwiedemann/openSUSE/blob/2de2525ff4f22f16243444d8222f304029402f46/packages/g/govulncheck-vulndb/govulncheck-vulndb.changes","https://github.com/proshiba/vuln-intel-agent/blob/1f0b4d834689f794b1d2ed00137cff546bba1cbe/reports/daily/2026/07/2026-07-17.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0642.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0642.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0642.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0640","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0640.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-55987","title":"Gitea OAuth2 登录绕过管理员账户停用漏洞","description":"Gitea 的 OAuth2 登录回调存在账户激活绕过漏洞。当用户通过不发放刷新令牌（refresh token）的认证源（如 GitHub 或未配置 `offline_access` 的 OIDC/OAuth2 源）登录时，系统会错误地将管理员已停用的账户（`IsActive=false`）重新激活。根本原因在于 PR #38009 的修复不完整：它使用 `RefreshToken == \"\"` 作为判断账户是否被自动同步定时任务禁用的信号，但对于从不发放刷新令牌的认证源，空 refresh token 是所有用户的正常状态，无法区分管理员手动停用与定时任务自动禁用。攻击者只需以被停用用户的身份通过该认证源重新登录，即可绕过管理员的停用操作，恢复账户活跃状态并获取完整会话权限。若被停用用户拥有管理员权限，恢复后也将重新获得管理员访问权限。该漏洞影响所有使用 GitHub 认证源或未配置 `offline_access` 的 OIDC/OAuth2 认证源的 Gitea 实例。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-55987","GHSA-vrhc-jjfc-m3m3"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 Gitea 至包含此漏洞修复的版本（≥1.24.x 对应补丁），修复 `routers/web/auth/oauth.go` 中 `handleOAuth2SignIn` 函数的激活门控逻辑：对于不签发 refresh token 的 OAuth2 认证源（如 GitHub），不应以 `RefreshToken == \"\"` 作为自动同步禁用的判断依据。临时缓解措施：在管理员禁用用户时同时勾选「禁止登录」（ProhibitLogin），该机制不受此漏洞影响；或为 OIDC 认证源配置 `offline_access` scope 使其签发 refresh token。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/code.gitea.io/gitea/CVE-2026-55987.yml","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/09e0eb937d6858d58d5e2a369c15112b42549508/2026/CVE-2026-55987.json","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/f53441b2a35b41554cbaabe0e42f9fb0b4a0b392/cve/CVE-2026-55987.html","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/7f04fb463deb2e42d892e6f9165c6eaca2feb1b6/data/osv/GO-2026-6078.json","https://github.com/RogoLabs/consensus-engine/blob/1492d9d80c64faf5568e48afb45bc3538bc6f9e0/docs/data/2026/CVE-2026-55987.json","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/7f04fb463deb2e42d892e6f9165c6eaca2feb1b6/data/reports/GO-2026-6078.yaml","https://github.com/rinz0x0cruz/exploitrank/blob/9f4c8add5cfa40b9d0aceff1e12c078575600f8b/data/history/CVE-2026-55987.json","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/f53441b2a35b41554cbaabe0e42f9fb0b4a0b392/api/intel/cve/CVE-2026-55987.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/236c7f1b4d135ead6953d68767892f06687ce11d/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-vrhc-jjfc-m3m3/GHSA-vrhc-jjfc-m3m3.json","https://github.com/proshiba/vuln-intel-agent/blob/1f0b4d834689f794b1d2ed00137cff546bba1cbe/reports/daily/2026/07/2026-07-17.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0640.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0639","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0639.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-55984","title":"Gitea Gitea AddTime API 空指针解引用拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Gitea 的 AddTime API 中存在空指针解引用漏洞。当仓库管理员在 `POST /api/v1/repos/{owner}/{repo}/issues/{index}/times` 端点中指定不存在的用户名时，`GetUserByName()` 返回错误但程序未停止执行，后续代码对空用户指针进行解引用操作，导致运行时 panic 引发拒绝服务。该漏洞需要仓库管理员权限才能触发，影响 Gitea 相关版本。","severity":"LOW","score":3.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-55984","GHSA-m932-crvm-gcp5"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即升级 Gitea 至 v1.27.0 或更高版本，该版本已在 `routers/api/v1/repo/issue_tracked_time.go` 的 `GetUserByName()` 错误处理分支中补上了缺失的 `return` 语句，防止空指针解引用导致的 panic。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理层对 `POST /api/v1/repos/*/*/issues/*/times` 端点实施访问频率限制，并严格限制仓库管理员权限的授予范围，降低被恶意触发的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/code.gitea.io/gitea/CVE-2026-55984.yml","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/09e0eb937d6858d58d5e2a369c15112b42549508/2026/CVE-2026-55984.json","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/7f04fb463deb2e42d892e6f9165c6eaca2feb1b6/data/osv/GO-2026-6064.json","https://github.com/RogoLabs/consensus-engine/blob/1492d9d80c64faf5568e48afb45bc3538bc6f9e0/docs/data/2026/CVE-2026-55984.json","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/7f04fb463deb2e42d892e6f9165c6eaca2feb1b6/data/reports/GO-2026-6064.yaml","https://github.com/rinz0x0cruz/exploitrank/blob/9f4c8add5cfa40b9d0aceff1e12c078575600f8b/data/history/CVE-2026-55984.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/236c7f1b4d135ead6953d68767892f06687ce11d/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-m932-crvm-gcp5/GHSA-m932-crvm-gcp5.json","https://github.com/proshiba/vuln-intel-agent/blob/1f0b4d834689f794b1d2ed00137cff546bba1cbe/reports/daily/2026/07/2026-07-17.md","https://github.com/bitfront-se/vuln-list-temp/blob/3c95e5d49b7a6bc1f2abbc2dcc9d10efdd56a4c8/osv/go/gitea.dev/GO-2026-6064.json","https://github.com/proshiba/vuln-intel-agent/blob/1f0b4d834689f794b1d2ed00137cff546bba1cbe/vulndb/vulns/gitea/2026/07/VW-2026-0837.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0639.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0639.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0639.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0638","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0638.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-55982","title":"Gitea OIDC userinfo 端点 API 令牌作用域绕过漏洞","description":"Gitea 的 OIDC 用户信息端点（`GET /login/oauth/userinfo`）在接收 Gitea API 令牌作为 Bearer 凭证时，未对 API 令牌的作用域进行权限校验。攻击者仅需持有作用域为 `read:misc` 的个人访问令牌，即可通过该端点获取用户的身份信息（包括邮箱、组织及团队成员信息），而相同令牌访问需要 `read:user` 等作用域的 REST API 端点时会被正确拒绝。该漏洞削弱了 Gitea API 令牌作用域的权限隔离机制，导致身份信息泄露，但不会影响仓库、问题、PR 等数据。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-55982","GHSA-mg4f-x9v4-6h2p"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即将 Gitea 升级至 v1.27.0 或更高版本，该版本已修复 OIDC userinfo 端点未正确校验 API Token 作用域的问题。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理层限制对 `/login/oauth/userinfo` 路径的访问，仅允许受信任的 OAuth 客户端调用，并审查现有 API Token 的权限分配。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/code.gitea.io/gitea/CVE-2026-55982.yml","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/08990b84a65d14f7de760be267bdf98ec816883a/2026/CVE-2026-55982.json","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/7f04fb463deb2e42d892e6f9165c6eaca2feb1b6/data/osv/GO-2026-6065.json","https://github.com/RogoLabs/consensus-engine/blob/37afb286f60474432f1104a39066604c98d29fb1/docs/data/2026/CVE-2026-55982.json","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/7f04fb463deb2e42d892e6f9165c6eaca2feb1b6/data/reports/GO-2026-6065.yaml","https://github.com/rinz0x0cruz/exploitrank/blob/9f4c8add5cfa40b9d0aceff1e12c078575600f8b/data/history/CVE-2026-55982.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b7bbf15f0e05d1782d743f08249f571d123d968/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-mg4f-x9v4-6h2p/GHSA-mg4f-x9v4-6h2p.json","https://github.com/proshiba/vuln-intel-agent/blob/1f0b4d834689f794b1d2ed00137cff546bba1cbe/reports/daily/2026/07/2026-07-17.md","https://github.com/bitfront-se/vuln-list-temp/blob/3c95e5d49b7a6bc1f2abbc2dcc9d10efdd56a4c8/osv/go/gitea.dev/GO-2026-6065.json","https://github.com/proshiba/vuln-intel-agent/blob/1f0b4d834689f794b1d2ed00137cff546bba1cbe/vulndb/vulns/gitea/2026/07/VW-2026-0836.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0638.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0638.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0638.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0629","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0629.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-55630","title":"Kiwi TCMS 测试管理平台 extra_link 字段存储型跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Kiwi TCMS 的 TestCase.extra_link 和 TestPlan.extra_link 字段设计用于存储外部资源 URL，但在 16.1 版本之前未对用户输入进行任何清理或转义处理，导致恶意用户可构造包含 JavaScript: URI 的链接并存储于这些字段中。当其他用户访问包含恶意链接的测试用例或测试计划页面时，浏览器会直接执行该 JavaScript 代码，造成存储型跨站脚本攻击。攻击者无需认证即可在目标页面中嵌入恶意脚本，窃取用户会话 Cookie 或执行其他恶意操作。官方 Docker 镜像默认启用的 Content-Security-Policy 头可阻止内联 JavaScript 执行，在一定程度上降低了实际利用风险，但修改了默认安全配置的部署环境仍可能受影响。Kiwi TCMS 团队已在 16.1 版本中修复此问题，对 extra_link 字段进行严格清理，并将已有不合规记录重置为空值。","severity":"LOW","score":3.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-55630","GHSA-473p-56xx-vg67"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即升级 Kiwi TCMS 至 16.1 或更高版本。升级后，`TestCase.extra_link` 和 `TestPlan.extra_link` 字段的用户输入将被正确清理，已有不合规数据库记录将被重置为 null。如使用 Docker 部署，拉取最新镜像 `pub.kiwitcms.eu/kiwitcms/kiwi:latest` 重新部署。如无法立即升级，确保保留默认 Content-Security-Policy 头以阻止内联 JavaScript 执行，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/pypi/kiwitcms/CVE-2026-55630.yml","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/9382985b1487c13b41847f6783f502ebface6ca6/2026/CVE-2026-55630.json","https://github.com/RogoLabs/consensus-engine/blob/37afb286f60474432f1104a39066604c98d29fb1/docs/data/2026/CVE-2026-55630.json","https://github.com/pypa/advisory-database/blob/9cd2bb0b0eb73e13c8961a77b5af61d5a521984f/vulns/kiwitcms/PYSEC-2026-2551.yaml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7b437709e7540c8c9af0a3ecc5a6f3df80f4ff33/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-473p-56xx-vg67/GHSA-473p-56xx-vg67.json","https://github.com/kiwitcms/kiwitcms.github.io/blob/b5a8b665f58abbaf74f674e056e1a455a49e5e32/blog/index.html","https://github.com/kiwitcms/kiwitcms.github.io/blob/b5a8b665f58abbaf74f674e056e1a455a49e5e32/blog/tags/releases/index.html","https://github.com/kiwitcms/kiwitcms.github.io/blob/b5a8b665f58abbaf74f674e056e1a455a49e5e32/blog/kiwi-tcms-team/index.html","https://github.com/kiwitcms/kiwitcms.github.io/blob/b5a8b665f58abbaf74f674e056e1a455a49e5e32/blog/kiwi-tcms-team/2026/06/24/kiwi-tcms-161/index.html","https://github.com/bitfront-se/vuln-list-temp/blob/3c95e5d49b7a6bc1f2abbc2dcc9d10efdd56a4c8/osv/python/kiwitcms/PYSEC-2026-2551.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0629.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0629.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0621","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0621.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-55513","title":"Slack Nebula Mesh Web UI 主机创建注册令牌有效期绕过漏洞","description":"nebula-mesh（Nebula 网络管理工具）的 Web UI 主机创建路径未使用服务端配置的注册令牌 TTL 解析器，而是硬编码 24 小时过期时间。API 路径正确调用 tokenTTLFor 函数遵循配置策略，但 POST /ui/hosts 接口始终设置 ExpiresAt: now.Add(24 * time.Hour)。认证后的 Web UI 操作员可通过创建主机操作绕过管理员配置的短生命周期策略（如 30 分钟），获取有效期长达 24 小时的承载令牌。该令牌可用于公共注册端点，延长了令牌泄露后的利用窗口，削弱了依赖短令牌生命周期部署场景的机密性与完整性。影响版本为 v0.3.0 至 v0.3.8。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-55513","GHSA-g4x6-jcvr-9m3g"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级到 nebula-mesh v0.3.9 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，手动修改 `internal/web/handlers.go:879` 将 `now.Add(24 * time.Hour)` 替换为 `now.Add(s.tokenTTLFor(r.Context(), host.NetworkID))`，使 Web UI 路径复用 API 的 TTL 解析逻辑。同时建议审计所有已签发的 enrollment token，对过期时间超过配置值的 token 执行吊销操作。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3a9acb85c323f70b3c41e59a73040cf73e226b4d/2026/CVE-2026-55513.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/github.com/forgekeep/nebula-mesh/CVE-2026-55513.yml","https://github.com/RogoLabs/consensus-engine/blob/37afb286f60474432f1104a39066604c98d29fb1/docs/data/2026/CVE-2026-55513.json","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/7f04fb463deb2e42d892e6f9165c6eaca2feb1b6/data/reports/GO-2026-5987.yaml","https://github.com/rinz0x0cruz/exploitrank/blob/9f4c8add5cfa40b9d0aceff1e12c078575600f8b/data/history/CVE-2026-55513.json","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/7f04fb463deb2e42d892e6f9165c6eaca2feb1b6/data/osv/GO-2026-5987.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7b437709e7540c8c9af0a3ecc5a6f3df80f4ff33/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-g4x6-jcvr-9m3g/GHSA-g4x6-jcvr-9m3g.json","https://github.com/bmwiedemann/openSUSE/blob/2de2525ff4f22f16243444d8222f304029402f46/packages/g/govulncheck-vulndb/govulncheck-vulndb.changes","https://github.com/midnightconman/go_vulndb/blob/d993e2e5e84dd30ceb1958dc17e25f002fffd6f7/ID/GO-2026-5987.json","https://github.com/proshiba/vuln-intel-agent/blob/1f0b4d834689f794b1d2ed00137cff546bba1cbe/vulndb/vulns/github/2026/07/VW-2026-29762.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0621.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0621.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0620","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0620.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-55512","title":"ForgeKeep nebula-mesh OIDC 登录端点未授权内存状态耗尽漏洞","description":"ForgeKeep nebula-mesh 项目在启用 OIDC 认证时，`GET /ui/oidc/login` 端点未进行身份认证且未注册在速率限制路由组内。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可向该端点发送大量请求，每次请求都会在服务端内存中创建并存储一个有效期为 10 分钟的随机 OIDC 状态值，且服务端未对状态总数或请求速率进行限制，导致内存无限增长，最终造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 nebula-mesh v0.2.0 至 v0.4.0 版本，已在 v0.5.0 中修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-55512","GHSA-m3cx-mwpg-32jg"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即升级到 nebula-mesh v0.5.0 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，在 `internal/web/web.go` 中将 `GET /ui/oidc/login` 路由注册移入已受 `auth` 速率限制的路由组内，或在 `HandleLogin` 函数入口处增加全局 OIDC 状态上限（如最大 1000 条）和单客户端速率限制，超出时返回 429 状态码拒绝请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3a9acb85c323f70b3c41e59a73040cf73e226b4d/2026/CVE-2026-55512.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/github.com/forgekeep/nebula-mesh/CVE-2026-55512.yml","https://github.com/RogoLabs/consensus-engine/blob/37afb286f60474432f1104a39066604c98d29fb1/docs/data/2026/CVE-2026-55512.json","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/7f04fb463deb2e42d892e6f9165c6eaca2feb1b6/data/reports/GO-2026-5989.yaml","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/7f04fb463deb2e42d892e6f9165c6eaca2feb1b6/data/osv/GO-2026-5989.json","https://github.com/rinz0x0cruz/exploitrank/blob/9f4c8add5cfa40b9d0aceff1e12c078575600f8b/data/history/CVE-2026-55512.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7b437709e7540c8c9af0a3ecc5a6f3df80f4ff33/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-m3cx-mwpg-32jg/GHSA-m3cx-mwpg-32jg.json","https://github.com/bmwiedemann/openSUSE/blob/2de2525ff4f22f16243444d8222f304029402f46/packages/g/govulncheck-vulndb/govulncheck-vulndb.changes","https://github.com/midnightconman/go_vulndb/blob/d993e2e5e84dd30ceb1958dc17e25f002fffd6f7/ID/GO-2026-5989.json","https://github.com/proshiba/vuln-intel-agent/blob/1f0b4d834689f794b1d2ed00137cff546bba1cbe/vulndb/vulns/github/2026/07/VW-2026-29761.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0620.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0620.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0620.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0619","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0619.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-55502","title":"Cloudreve Cloudreve OAuth作用域授权绕过漏洞","description":"Cloudreve 4.16.1 存在 OAuth 授权作用域绕过漏洞。由于管理员路由组中 `POST /api/v4/admin/policy/oauth/signin` 接口未添加 `Admin.Write` 作用域守卫，仅拥有 `Admin.Read` 只读权限的 OAuth 令牌可调用该接口修改 OneDrive 存储策略的密钥和 App ID 等凭据。攻击者通过构造包含恶意 `secret` 和 `app_id` 字段的 JSON 请求，可篡改存储后端配置，导致存储服务异常或重定向 OAuth 认证流程至攻击者控制的应用参数。该漏洞影响 Cloudreve 4.16.1 版本，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高危。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-55502","GHSA-hq88-5x99-x3gf"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 Cloudreve 至 4.16.2 或更高版本，该版本已在 `routers/router.go` 中为 `oauth.POST(\"signin\")` 路由添加了 `middleware.RequiredScopes(types.ScopeAdminWrite)` 守卫。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理层（如 Nginx）限制 `POST /api/v4/admin/policy/oauth/signin` 接口仅允许受信 IP 访问，并审计所有 OAuth 客户端权限，撤销仅授予 `Admin.Read` 作用域的第三方应用令牌。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3a9acb85c323f70b3c41e59a73040cf73e226b4d/2026/CVE-2026-55502.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/github.com/cloudreve/Cloudreve/v4/CVE-2026-55502.yml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7b437709e7540c8c9af0a3ecc5a6f3df80f4ff33/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-hq88-5x99-x3gf/GHSA-hq88-5x99-x3gf.json","https://github.com/RogoLabs/consensus-engine/blob/37afb286f60474432f1104a39066604c98d29fb1/docs/data/2026/CVE-2026-55502.json","https://github.com/JsHuang/sec-advisory-daily/blob/86aea41dd2762b8ae57edf00dafe081b4536e32d/reports/report-2026-07-27.html","https://github.com/proshiba/vuln-intel-agent/blob/1f0b4d834689f794b1d2ed00137cff546bba1cbe/vulndb/vulns/github/2026/07/VW-2026-35896.yaml","https://github.com/rinz0x0cruz/exploitrank/blob/9f4c8add5cfa40b9d0aceff1e12c078575600f8b/data/history/CVE-2026-55502.json","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/5ccc0121befc0e774231310e59ab57c07c20c8e8/ai-security-intel-memory.json","https://github.com/bitfront-se/vuln-list-temp/blob/3c95e5d49b7a6bc1f2abbc2dcc9d10efdd56a4c8/ghsa/go/github.com/cloudreve/Cloudreve/v3/GHSA-hq88-5x99-x3gf.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/github.com/cloudreve/Cloudreve/v3/CVE-2026-55502.yml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0619.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0619.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0619.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0616","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0616.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-55499","title":"Cloudreve 文件事件流越权访问漏洞","description":"Cloudreve 文件事件流存在越权访问漏洞。当单文件分享的接收者打开文件事件流（`GET /api/v4/file/events?uri=<share-root>`）时，系统将订阅者注册到分享文件所属的父文件夹而非文件本身，导致接收者能够实时接收父文件夹中其他未分享文件的活动事件（包括创建、重命名、修改、删除等操作及文件名元数据）。攻击者只需拥有有效的单文件分享链接并登录认证即可触发，无需额外权限。该漏洞影响 Cloudreve 3.x 及 4.x 版本，CVSS 评分 5.4，危害等级中危。虽然不直接泄露文件内容，但暴露了未授权文件的元数据信息，可能被用于进一步的信息收集和攻击。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-55499","GHSA-w8x7-h2px-xmq8"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即升级 Cloudreve 至 v4.18.0 或更高版本（该版本已通过 commit 0b00dd3 修复，在单文件分享视图下拒绝事件流订阅）。如无法立即升级，可在管理面板中将 `fs_event_push_enabled` 设为 `0` 以临时禁用文件事件推送功能，阻断信息泄露风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3a9acb85c323f70b3c41e59a73040cf73e226b4d/2026/CVE-2026-55499.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/github.com/cloudreve/Cloudreve/v3/CVE-2026-55499.yml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7b437709e7540c8c9af0a3ecc5a6f3df80f4ff33/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-w8x7-h2px-xmq8/GHSA-w8x7-h2px-xmq8.json","https://github.com/RogoLabs/consensus-engine/blob/37afb286f60474432f1104a39066604c98d29fb1/docs/data/2026/CVE-2026-55499.json","https://github.com/proshiba/vuln-intel-agent/blob/1f0b4d834689f794b1d2ed00137cff546bba1cbe/vulndb/vulns/github/2026/07/VW-2026-35895.yaml","https://github.com/rinz0x0cruz/exploitrank/blob/9f4c8add5cfa40b9d0aceff1e12c078575600f8b/data/history/CVE-2026-55499.json","https://github.com/bitfront-se/vuln-list-temp/blob/3c95e5d49b7a6bc1f2abbc2dcc9d10efdd56a4c8/osv/go/github.com/cloudreve/Cloudreve/v4/GHSA-w8x7-h2px-xmq8.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/github.com/cloudreve/Cloudreve/v4/CVE-2026-55499.yml","https://github.com/bitfront-se/vuln-list-temp/blob/3c95e5d49b7a6bc1f2abbc2dcc9d10efdd56a4c8/ghsa/go/github.com/cloudreve/Cloudreve/v4/GHSA-w8x7-h2px-xmq8.json","https://github.com/bitfront-se/vuln-list-temp/blob/3c95e5d49b7a6bc1f2abbc2dcc9d10efdd56a4c8/ghsa/go/github.com/cloudreve/Cloudreve/v3/GHSA-w8x7-h2px-xmq8.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0616.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0615","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0615.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-55497","title":"Cloudreve Cloudreve 图片解码拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Cloudreve 内置图片处理器存在拒绝服务漏洞。该软件使用 Go 标准库（image/png、image/jpeg、image/gif）解码用户上传的图片，但仅对压缩文件大小进行限制（最大 75MB），未对解码后的像素尺寸设置上限。攻击者可构造一个仅 65 字节的恶意 PNG 图片，在其 IHDR 块中声明极大的宽高值（如 2147483647×16），触发 Go 运行时分配约 128GB 的像素缓冲区（4×宽×高），导致内核 OOM Killer 终止进程或 Go 运行时抛出致命内存不足错误，造成整个 Cloudreve 服务崩溃。该漏洞可通过两个入口触发：任意已认证用户通过头像上传接口（PUT /api/v4/user/setting/avatar）发送单次请求即可触发；或通过默认启用的缩略图生成功能，将炸弹图片存入公开分享链接后由匿名访问者触发。攻击成本极低（65 字节），可反复执行导致服务持续不可用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-55497","GHSA-g9j2-8w95-3vwv"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 Cloudreve 至修复版本，在 `pkg/thumb/builtin.go` 的 `NewThumbFromFile` 函数中调用 `image.DecodeConfig` 预检查图像像素尺寸，限制解码像素总数不超过 5000 万像素（50 MP），同时对头像上传和缩略图生成路径统一施加该限制。如无法立即升级，可临时关闭内置缩略图生成器（将 `thumb_builtin_enabled` 设为 `0`）并启用 libvips 替代方案（`thumb_vips_enabled` 设为 `1`），同时在反向代理层限制头像上传的 Content-Type 仅为可信格式。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3a9acb85c323f70b3c41e59a73040cf73e226b4d/2026/CVE-2026-55497.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/github.com/cloudreve/Cloudreve/v3/CVE-2026-55497.yml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7b437709e7540c8c9af0a3ecc5a6f3df80f4ff33/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-g9j2-8w95-3vwv/GHSA-g9j2-8w95-3vwv.json","https://github.com/RogoLabs/consensus-engine/blob/37afb286f60474432f1104a39066604c98d29fb1/docs/data/2026/CVE-2026-55497.json","https://github.com/proshiba/vuln-intel-agent/blob/1f0b4d834689f794b1d2ed00137cff546bba1cbe/vulndb/vulns/github/2026/07/VW-2026-35894.yaml","https://github.com/rinz0x0cruz/exploitrank/blob/9f4c8add5cfa40b9d0aceff1e12c078575600f8b/data/history/CVE-2026-55497.json","https://github.com/bitfront-se/vuln-list-temp/blob/3c95e5d49b7a6bc1f2abbc2dcc9d10efdd56a4c8/osv/go/github.com/cloudreve/Cloudreve/v4/GHSA-g9j2-8w95-3vwv.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/github.com/cloudreve/Cloudreve/v4/CVE-2026-55497.yml","https://github.com/bitfront-se/vuln-list-temp/blob/3c95e5d49b7a6bc1f2abbc2dcc9d10efdd56a4c8/ghsa/go/github.com/cloudreve/Cloudreve/v4/GHSA-g9j2-8w95-3vwv.json","https://github.com/bitfront-se/vuln-list-temp/blob/3c95e5d49b7a6bc1f2abbc2dcc9d10efdd56a4c8/ghsa/go/github.com/cloudreve/Cloudreve/v3/GHSA-g9j2-8w95-3vwv.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0615.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0615.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0614","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0614.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-55496","title":"Cloudreve: Information Exposure in `GET /api/v4/user/search`: `SearchActive` omits the active-status predicate, leaking inactive/banned account emails 漏洞","description":"Cloudreve 用户搜索接口存在信息泄露漏洞。`GET /api/v4/user/search` 接口对任意登录用户开放，其后端 `SearchActive` 方法仅按邮箱/昵称关键词过滤，但未添加 `StatusActive` 状态谓词，导致已禁用、封禁的非活跃账户也被返回。攻击者只需拥有有效登录会话，使用 2 字符以上关键词即可枚举并获取非活跃用户的邮箱、昵称、头像等个人信息，构成 PII 泄露与用户枚举风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-55496","GHSA-8r7f-r8hj-r3rv"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即升级 Cloudreve 至修复版本（≥v4.x 中已添加 `StatusActive` 谓词的 commit），或在 `service/user/info.go` 的 `SearchActive` 函数中手动添加 `Where(user.StatusEQ(user.StatusActive))` 条件过滤非活跃用户；同时修改 `GET /api/v4/user/info/:id` 接口，对非活跃/封禁账号返回匿名级别脱敏数据，并移除搜索接口返回的邮箱字段。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3a9acb85c323f70b3c41e59a73040cf73e226b4d/2026/CVE-2026-55496.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/github.com/cloudreve/Cloudreve/v4/CVE-2026-55496.yml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7b437709e7540c8c9af0a3ecc5a6f3df80f4ff33/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-8r7f-r8hj-r3rv/GHSA-8r7f-r8hj-r3rv.json","https://github.com/RogoLabs/consensus-engine/blob/37afb286f60474432f1104a39066604c98d29fb1/docs/data/2026/CVE-2026-55496.json","https://github.com/proshiba/vuln-intel-agent/blob/1f0b4d834689f794b1d2ed00137cff546bba1cbe/vulndb/vulns/github/2026/07/VW-2026-35893.yaml","https://github.com/rinz0x0cruz/exploitrank/blob/9f4c8add5cfa40b9d0aceff1e12c078575600f8b/data/history/CVE-2026-55496.json","https://github.com/bitfront-se/vuln-list-temp/blob/3c95e5d49b7a6bc1f2abbc2dcc9d10efdd56a4c8/ghsa/go/github.com/cloudreve/Cloudreve/v3/GHSA-8r7f-r8hj-r3rv.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/github.com/cloudreve/Cloudreve/v3/CVE-2026-55496.yml","https://github.com/bitfront-se/vuln-list-temp/blob/3c95e5d49b7a6bc1f2abbc2dcc9d10efdd56a4c8/osv/go/github.com/cloudreve/Cloudreve/v4/GHSA-8r7f-r8hj-r3rv.json","https://github.com/bitfront-se/vuln-list-temp/blob/3c95e5d49b7a6bc1f2abbc2dcc9d10efdd56a4c8/ghsa/go/github.com/cloudreve/Cloudreve/v4/GHSA-8r7f-r8hj-r3rv.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0614.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0613","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0613.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-55495","title":"Cloudreve WOPI PUT_RELATIVE 路径遍历漏洞","description":"Cloudreve 的 WOPI PUT_RELATIVE 处理程序存在路径遍历漏洞。该漏洞源于程序将 `X-WOPI-SuggestedTarget` 头部视为路径而非文件名，通过 `URI.JoinRaw` 调用 Go 的 `url.JoinPath` 解析 `../` 等相对路径段。攻击者可在已获取单文件 WOPI 访问令牌的情况下，构造包含 `a/../../evil.docx` 等遍历序列的 `X-WOPI-SuggestedTarget` 头部，将文件写入同一用户账户下的任意目录（如账户根目录），而后续上传校验仅检查清理后的文件名（如 `evil.docx`），导致绕过单文件作用域限制。该漏洞影响 Cloudreve 4.x 版本，危害等级中危，攻击者可在同一用户账户内创建或覆盖文件。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-55495","GHSA-49h3-cwhj-4737"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 Cloudreve 至修复该漏洞的版本（≥v4.x 补丁版），或在 WOPI 处理函数中对 `X-WOPI-SuggestedTarget` 和 `X-WOPI-RequestedName` 头进行严格路径过滤：拒绝包含 `/`、`\\`、`.`、`..` 及 URL 编码变体的输入，仅允许纯文件名。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理层拦截含路径分隔符的 `X-WOPI-SuggestedTarget` 请求头作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3a9acb85c323f70b3c41e59a73040cf73e226b4d/2026/CVE-2026-55495.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/github.com/cloudreve/Cloudreve/v3/CVE-2026-55495.yml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/8fd24b26179bcdde52e301aef6d16b0838932c28/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-49h3-cwhj-4737/GHSA-49h3-cwhj-4737.json","https://github.com/RogoLabs/consensus-engine/blob/37afb286f60474432f1104a39066604c98d29fb1/docs/data/2026/CVE-2026-55495.json","https://github.com/proshiba/vuln-intel-agent/blob/1f0b4d834689f794b1d2ed00137cff546bba1cbe/vulndb/vulns/github/2026/07/VW-2026-35892.yaml","https://github.com/rinz0x0cruz/exploitrank/blob/9f4c8add5cfa40b9d0aceff1e12c078575600f8b/data/history/CVE-2026-55495.json","https://github.com/bitfront-se/vuln-list-temp/blob/3c95e5d49b7a6bc1f2abbc2dcc9d10efdd56a4c8/osv/go/github.com/cloudreve/Cloudreve/v4/GHSA-49h3-cwhj-4737.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/github.com/cloudreve/Cloudreve/v4/CVE-2026-55495.yml","https://github.com/bitfront-se/vuln-list-temp/blob/3c95e5d49b7a6bc1f2abbc2dcc9d10efdd56a4c8/ghsa/go/github.com/cloudreve/Cloudreve/v4/GHSA-49h3-cwhj-4737.json","https://github.com/bitfront-se/vuln-list-temp/blob/3c95e5d49b7a6bc1f2abbc2dcc9d10efdd56a4c8/ghsa/go/github.com/cloudreve/Cloudreve/v3/GHSA-49h3-cwhj-4737.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0613.toml"}]